      "guide": "Second time's the charm. UNCONFIRMED: PowerPyx lists this trophy as currently unknown, believed to be related to the Payday Loans store from the Prologue. No verified steps exist yet — this guide lists it honestly rather than inventing a method. Watch the Payday Loan shops as you play and check back.",
